virtually *anything.*

So fuck the present. It's the Futopia I'm working on here.

II. POSTULATES FOR POST SCARCITY: Disprove any of these to me and
PostScarcity vanishes like an ex-socialists wet dream.

1) Population comes under our conscious control, making squabbling
over ever finer divisions of the ever expanding pie unnecessary or
